{
        "schema_version": 1,
        "_readme": [
                "Package manifest for tools/install.py. JSON rather than TOML on purpose:",
                "tomllib is Python 3.11+ and Ubuntu 22.04 still ships 3.10, which would break",
                "the stdlib-only constraint.",
                "",
                "Each package has a default 'name' used for every manager. 'overrides' gives a",
                "per-manager name; an override of null means the package is not available there",
                "and is skipped silently.",
                "",
                "'unverified' lists managers whose resolved name has NOT been confirmed against a",
                "real package manager. install.py validates every name against the local package",
                "manager before installing anything, so a wrong name here fails loudly with the",
                "full list rather than silently installing the wrong thing. Once you have",
                "confirmed a name on a real box, drop that manager from the list.",
                "",
                "The 'arch', 'freebsd', 'debian', 'ubuntu' and 'macos' columns are fully verified against a real package manager on the respective box. The others are not.",
                "'gentoo' is the least trustworthy column: atoms need a category prefix and none",
                "of them have been checked. Packages with no known gentoo atom omit the key",
                "entirely, which install.py reports as unmapped.",
                "",
                "group 'core' = CLI tools, installed everywhere.",
                "group 'desktop' = Arch/Hyprland only, opt-in via --desktop, never on a headless",
                "target. Desktop entries carry \"os\": [\"arch\"].",
                "",
                "\"aur\": true means the Arch name lives in the AUR and needs an AUR helper (yay).",
                "",
                "Each manager's 'query' must exit 0 for a real package and non-zero for a fake one. That is easy to get wrong and the failure looks like every package name being invalid at once. Verified so far: arch, debian, ubuntu, freebsd, macos. NOT yet verified: fedora, gentoo -- if one of those reports that every name is missing, suspect the query command before the names.",
                "",
                "Managers that share a package manager binary are told apart by 'os_release_id', matched against ID in /etc/os-release. ubuntu and debian both use apt-get but ship different package sets: Ubuntu 24.04 predates the Debian uploads of lazygit and atuin. An apt distro that matches neither ID falls back to debian."
        ],
        "managers": {
                "arch": {
                        "os": "Linux",
                        "detect": "pacman",
                        "helper": "yay",
                        "install": [
                                "yay",
                                "-S",
                                "--needed",
                                "--noconfirm"
                        ],
                        "install_no_aur": [
                                "sudo",
                                "pacman",
                                "-S",
                                "--needed",
                                "--noconfirm"
                        ],
                        "query": [
                                "pacman",
                                "-Si",
                                "--"
                        ],
                        "aur_query": [
                                "yay",
                                "-Si",
                                "--"
                        ],
                        "sudo": false
                },
                "freebsd": {
                        "os": "FreeBSD",
                        "detect": "pkg",
                        "install": [
                                "sudo",
                                "pkg",
                                "install",
                                "-y"
                        ],
                        "query": [
                                "pkg",
                                "search",
                                "-e",
                                "-S",
                                "name",
                                "-q"
                        ],
                        "sudo": true
                },
                "macos": {
                        "os": "Darwin",
                        "detect": "brew",
                        "install": [
                                "brew",
                                "install"
                        ],
                        "query": [
                                "brew",
                                "info",
                                "--formula",
                                "--"
                        ],
                        "sudo": false
                },
                "debian": {
                        "os": "Linux",
                        "detect": "apt-get",
                        "install": [
                                "sudo",
                                "apt-get",
                                "install",
                                "-y"
                        ],
                        "query": [
                                "apt-cache",
                                "show",
                                "--"
                        ],
                        "sudo": true,
                        "os_release_id": [
                                "debian"
                        ]
                },
                "ubuntu": {
                        "os": "Linux",
                        "detect": "apt-get",
                        "install": [
                                "sudo",
                                "apt-get",
                                "install",
                                "-y"
                        ],
                        "query": [
                                "apt-cache",
                                "show",
                                "--"
                        ],
                        "sudo": true,
                        "os_release_id": [
                                "ubuntu"
                        ]
                },
                "fedora": {
                        "os": "Linux",
                        "detect": "dnf",
                        "install": [
                                "sudo",
                                "dnf",
                                "install",
                                "-y"
                        ],
                        "query": [
                                "dnf",
                                "info",
                                "--"
                        ],
                        "sudo": true
                },
                "gentoo": {
                        "os": "Linux",
                        "detect": "emerge",
                        "install": [
                                "sudo",
                                "emerge",
                                "--noreplace"
                        ],
                        "query": [
                                "emerge",
                                "--pretend",
                                "--quiet",
                                "--"
                        ],
                        "sudo": true
                }
        },
